    "body": "Problem:\r\nUnclosed `*` (or a closing `*` followed by text) is parsed as a tag, so\r\nNvim conceals the `*` in e.g.:\r\n\r\n    '[\\/]$,*,\\.bak$,\\.o$,\r\n    au BufRead *.c,*.h foo\r\n\r\nSolution:\r\nLike `:helptags`, require the closing `*` to be followed by whitespace\r\nor EOL. Otherwise it's plain text (also in h3 headings).\r\n\r\nfix https://github.com/neovim/tree-sitter-vimdoc/issues/168",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-14T15:57:36Z",
